
# Implementation Plan - Phase 9 (Knowledge Retrieval)

## Goal
Enable agents to search and read "Long-term Memory" (.brain/memory/).

## Changes
### `mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/memory.py` [NEW]
- `_search_memory(query)`: Uses `subprocess.run(["rg", ...])` to search `.brain/memory/` and `decisions.md`.
- `_read_memory(category)`: logic to return content of `context.md`, `patterns.md`, `learnings.md`.

### `mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py` [MODIFY]
- Register `brain_search_memory` tool.
- Register `brain_read_memory` tool.

## Verification
- Create `tests/test_memory.py`.
- Write dummy content to `.brain/memory/test_mem.md`.
- Assert `_search_memory` finds it.
